#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Review artifact helpers for Scherzo dogfood workflows.

This script is intentionally outside the Scherzo runtime. It provides
no-side-effect helpers for staged code-review artifacts: inspect a PR or local
diff, prepare shared native review inputs, verify native lane evidence,
normalize lane results, synthesize findings, and validate local review
artifacts. Production implementation workflows use native Scherzo agent lane
steps rather than script-level lane backends.
"""

